              %strong 71
              (1947) 622 (
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRev.71.622"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRev.71.622
              )
          %p The synthesis/detection of graphene is due to
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Konstantin+Novoselov"}> Konstantin Novoselov
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andre+Geim"} Andre Geim
              = succeed "," do
