              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1126/science.1102896"} doi:10.1126/science.1102896
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/cond-mat/0410550"} arXiv:cond-mat/0410550
          %p (The procedure, won a Nobel Prize and the authors made it freely available without patenting.)
          %p
            Further discussion of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/electron+band+structure"} electron band structure
